#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:2
#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:6
msgid "Gigabit PoE Shield"
msgstr "Gigabit PoE Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Gigabit PoE Shield is a 10/100/1000 Mb/s Ethernet shield with 802.3af "
"Power-over-Ethernet for OpenMV Cams that have an on-board Ethernet PHY. One "
"cable to a PoE switch carries both power and the network link."
msgstr ""
"El Gigabit PoE Shield es un shield Ethernet de 10/100/1000 Mb/s con "
"alimentación a través de Ethernet (PoE) 802.3af para OpenMV Cams que "
"disponen de un PHY Ethernet integrado. Un único cable a un conmutador PoE "
"transporta tanto la alimentación como el enlace de red."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `Gigabit PoE Shield product"
" page <https://openmv.io/products/gigabit-poe-shield>`_."
msgstr ""
"Para consultar la hoja de datos completa, fotos e información de compra, "
"visite la `página del producto Gigabit PoE Shield "
"<https://openmv.io/products/gigabit-poe-shield>`_."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:16
msgid "Supported only on the OpenMV Cam RT1062 and N6."
msgstr "Compatible únicamente con la OpenMV Cam RT1062 y N6."

